8.12 evening analysis
Our Bollinger Orange short-term position has already been taken at 64300.
At present, the $BTC 15-minute cycle fluctuation range is: intraday high 64450.0, intraday low 63211.6.
The short-term market has completed a round of sustained long-bias rally: after rising from the 63211 low, the price continued to consolidate and move higher; the lows and highs rose in step, and the continuity of the long trend is relatively strong. After pushing up, it touched the 64450 peak and then quickly formed a long upper-wick bearish candle. Short-term long momentum shows a phased exhaustion, and profit-taking/exit pressure has concentrated release with a two-line structure: the DIF continues to run stably above the DEA; the two lines move upward in sync and diverge upward, and both lines remain far above the zero axis. The short-term long trend on the bigger picture remains intact, and the medium-to-long-term long momentum has not yet been completely depleted;
​The MACD stays in bullish red bars, but the red bar height has slightly contracted compared with the rally peak, indicating that the marginal strength of the short-term long rally has weakened and the offensive momentum of the bulls has slightly declined;
One personal suggestion: around 64450-65000, continue; the target is around 63500-62800, then #BTC #ETH #BTC走势分析

8.12 Day $ETH  Evening Analysis
Overall market action is a low-level rebound after a sharp drop: earlier, prices probed the low around 1820.61, completing a deep pullback; afterward, buy-side support gradually took hold and stabilized. After this round retested the 1852 support and turned back up with a bullish close, the short-term bottom is slowly lifting. However, multiple previous highs above still act as resistance, so the sustainability of the rebound is questionable. This creates a dual-line structure: the DIF line turns upward from a low level and crosses above the DEA, forming a short-term golden cross; but overall, both lines remain below the zero axis. The broader bearish trend for the medium to long term has not changed—this is only a short-term technical rebound;
​Momentum bars: the indicator shifts from bearish green bars to faint bullish red bars. The red bar’s body volume is extremely small, meaning the rebound’s momentum is weak and lacks strong volume support for an aggressive upswing. Personal suggestion by Yifan: around 1910–1980, target around 1880–1815 near #BTC #ETH #BTC走势分析
